  "title": "Stuffed Green Pepper Soup",
  "description": "This stuffed green pepper soup recipe takes elements of stuffed peppers, such as ground beef, rice, and tomato sauce, and turns them into a hearty soup.",
  "authors": [
    "PatC"
  ],
